url: "https://github.com/<your-username>/durian-yield-ml-xgboost"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Python code for an interpretable XGBoost model predicting durian yield per
  hectare for 393 GAP-certified farms in Chanthaburi Province, Thailand.
  Includes leakage-free validation, SHAP analysis, feature ablation,
  counterfactual scenario simulation, and district fixed-effects benchmarks.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - XGBoost
  - SHAP
  - durian
  - agricultural economics
  - climate change
  - Thailand
